@startuml
!include https://static.visual-paradigm.com/web/resources/plantuml-stdlib/themes/vp.puml

title Auth - Register Account

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam activityFontName Arial
skinparam activityFontSize 14
skinparam activityBorderThickness 1.5
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam ArrowColor #222222
skinparam SwimlaneBorderColor #222222
skinparam SwimlaneBorderThickness 2
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #7DD3FC
  BorderColor #2563EB
  DiamondBackgroundColor #7DD3FC
  DiamondBorderColor #2563EB
  StartColor #111827
  EndColor #FFFFFF
}

|Guest|
start
note right
Precondition:
The user is not signed in.

Postcondition:
The account exists with a hashed password and the user
is signed in (access and refresh tokens). A seller
account stays PENDING until an admin approves it.
end note
:Open the registration form;
|System|
:Display the registration form;
|Guest|
repeat
:Enter name, email, password and choose the account type;
:Submit the registration;
|System|
if (The system fails while processing the request?) then (Yes)
  :Return the system error;
  |Guest|
  :View the system error;
  stop
else (No)
endif
|System|
:Validate the data, reject the ADMIN role and check the email is free;
backward :Return the registration error;
repeat while (The data is invalid, the role\nis ADMIN or the email is taken?) is (Yes) not (No)
:Create the account with a hashed password; a seller starts PENDING;
:Issue the access and refresh tokens and return the result;
|Guest|
:View the registration result;
stop

@enduml
